# AegisForge .gitignore
#
# Minimal and specific on purpose. Every rule names a real artifact type.
# Generic directory names (models/, index/, workspace/, release/) are
# deliberately absent: they are plausible source package names, and a
# .gitignore that silently swallows source is worse than one that misses a
# build artifact.
#
# Data folders are anchored with a leading slash (/private/, /secrets/,
# /logs/) so they match ONLY at the repository root. Unanchored, `private/`
# would also hide backend/private/auth.py. Dependency and build directories
# stay unanchored on purpose: node_modules/, dist/, and .venv/ legitimately
# appear inside backend/ and frontend/.
#
# The "never commit" list in docs/prd.md 15.3 is why the secret, weight, and
# installer sections exist.
#
# A .gitignore only affects files that are NOT already tracked.

# --- OS -------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Environment and secrets  (docs/prd.md 15.3, 16.5) --------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
/secrets/
/credentials/

# --- Model weights  (docs/prd.md 15.3) ------------------------------------
# Specific extensions only. `models/` is omitted: backend/models/ is a
# plausible source package. `*.bin` is omitted: too broad for test fixtures.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.ggml
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.mlmodel
*.mlpackage/
/weights/

# --- Generated installers and release binaries  (docs/prd.md 15.3, 16.5) --
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.exe
*.msi
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.rpm

# --- Private documents and real scans  (docs/prd.md 15.3, 16.3) -----------
# Put anything real or confidential here and it stays out of the repository.
# Fixtures committed to the repo must be synthetic or explicitly approved.
/private/
/scans/
/confidential/

# --- Local database state  (docs/prd.md 4.4, 15.3) ------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Node -----------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- Rust and Tauri -------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored so a source directory named `target` elsewhere is not swallowed.
/target/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# --- Logs and test output -------------------------------------------------
*.log
/logs/
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage
test-results/
playwright-report/

# --- Editor and local agent harness config --------------------------------
# AGENTS.md is shared. Tool-specific root instructions stay local.
# List both cases because Linux filesystems are case-sensitive.
CLAUDE.md
claude.md
CODEX.md
codex.md
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# --- Graphify local knowledge graph (regenerated locally) -----------------
graphify-out/
